# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions. Written 2026-11-22.
> position fen 7k/5K2/6Q1/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go infinite
> isready
# UCI go infinite and isready. No bestmove precedes readyok.
< readyok
> stop
# UCI stop/bestmove releases the held move for stalemate, 0000.
< bestmove 0000
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
